"claim\": \"Literature context: The Jackknife Estimate of Variance\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1214/aos/1176345462\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"EfronStein1981\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/EfronStein1981.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: An Introduction to the Bootstrap\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1007/978-1-4899-4541-9\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"EfronTibshirani1993\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/EfronTibshirani1993_consulted_excerpt.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Monte Carlo Methods in Financial Engineering\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1007/978-0-387-21617-1\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"Glasserman2004\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/Glasserman2004_consulted.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Generalized Cross-Validation as a Method for Choosing a Good Ridge Parameter\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1080/00401706.1979.10489751\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"Golub1979GCV\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/Golub1979GCV.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: The Elements of Statistical Learning\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1007/978-0-387-84858-7\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"Hastie2009\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/Hastie2009_consulted.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Probability Inequalities for Sums of Bounded Random Variables\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1080/01621459.1963.10500830\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"Hoeffding1963\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/Hoeffding1963.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Ridge Regression: Biased Estimation for Nonorthogonal Problems\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1080/00401706.1970.10488634\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"HoerlKennard1970\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/HoerlKennard1970.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Statistical Analysis with Missing Data\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1002/9781119013563\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"LittleRubin2019\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/LittleRubin2019.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Empirical Bernstein Bounds and Sample Variance Penalization\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.arxiv.0907.3740\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"MaurerPontil2009\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/MaurerPontil2009_consulted.txt\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Two-sided confidence intervals for the single proportion: comparison of seven methods\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1002/(sici)1097-0258(19980430)17:8<857::aid-sim777>3.0.co;2-e\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"Newcombe1998\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/Newcombe1998.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Root-N-Consistent Semiparametric Regression\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.2307/1912705\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"Robinson1988\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/Robinson1988.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Model Assisted Survey Sampling\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1007/978-1-4612-4378-6\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"Sarndal1992\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/Sarndal1992_consulted_excerpt.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Cross-Validatory Choice and Assessment of Statistical Predictions\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1111/j.2517-6161.1974.tb00994.x\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"Stone1974\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/Stone1974.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: The Probable Error of a Mean\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1093/biomet/6.1.1\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"Student1908\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/Student1908.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature context: Asymptotic Statistics\", \"source_ids\": [\"ref.doi.10.1017/cbo9780511802256\"], \"citation_keys\": [\"VanDerVaart1998\"], \"evidence_refs\": [\"literature/VanDerVaart1998.json\"], \"scope\": \"Bibliographic identity and consultation scope recorded in literature/; no numerical experimental claims sourced to references.\"}\nProvenance scopes:\nAgrestiCoull1998 : Abstract, not full paper\nAngelopoulos2023PPI : Selected primary PDF pages\nAngelopoulos2023PPIpp : Selected primary PDF pages\nAudibert2009 : HAL abstract for the exact historical work\nBenjaminiHochberg1995 : Abstract, not full paper\nBlythStill1983 : Abstract, not full paper\nBrownCaiDasGupta2001 : Abstract, not full paper\nChernozhukov2018DML : Abstract, not full paper\nDevilleSarndal1992 : Abstract, not full paper\nEfron1979 : Abstract, not full paper\nEfronStein1981 : Abstract, not full paper\nEfronTibshirani1993 : Publisher synopsis\nGlasserman2004 : Publisher synopsis\nGolub1979GCV : Abstract, not full paper\nHastie2009 : Publisher synopsis; full text unavailable\nHoeffding1963 : Abstract, not full paper\nHoerlKennard1970 : Abstract, not full paper\nLittleRubin2019 : Abstract, not full paper\nMaurerPontil2009 : Primary PDF pages including empirical-Bernstein theorem\nNewcombe1998 : Abstract, not full paper\nRobinson1988 : Abstract, not full paper\nSarndal1992 : Book synopsis\nStone1974 : Abstract, not full paper\nStudent1908 : Abstract, not full paper\nVanDerVaart1998 : Abstract, not full paper\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
